# synthetic corpus — scripts/synth-corpus.mjs
#
# The manifest is ignorable; the DIRECTORIES IT NAMES ARE NOT, because they sit
# under src/content/docs/ among real books and no pattern can tell them apart
# without also hiding real content. That asymmetry is the whole reason the
# manifest exists: `--clean` is the mechanism, and this line only stops the
# manifest itself from being committed by accident.
#
# ALWAYS run `npm run synth:clean` before committing.
.synth-corpus.json
